{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own museum</strong>. Find rare artifacts that impress your visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621210/extras/34cc92cf70d3b05e82404d7ba9d71b24.avif?t=1764284407\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621210/extras_big/34cc92cf70d3b05e82404d7ba9d71b24.avif?t=1764284407 width=800 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Museum Magnate</strong> is a <strong>3D museum tycoon game</strong> which gives you all the freedom you would expect from a tycoon game. Show your skills as a <strong>manager</strong> and <strong>builder</strong> and watch your museum grow and prosper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621210/extras/9ec1a87cc0da781a7592cc1ecb35e993.avif?t=1764284407\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621210/extras_big/9ec1a87cc0da781a7592cc1ecb35e993.avif?t=1764284407 width=800 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The included minigame sends you to <strong>excavations</strong>. Now it's up to you to find the rare artifacts which you present to your visitors inside your museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621210/extras/fa3f2be7a46d75b445e7d93b623ff578.avif?t=1764284407\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621210/extras_big/fa3f2be7a46d75b445e7d93b623ff578.avif?t=1764284407 width=800 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully manage all the work that a museum magnate has to handle. Be careful when hiring the right staff, wisely spend your money for the right 